      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Indicates that the device failed to authenticate with the carrier when uploading the picture. Clients that encounter this error should not retry the upload unless a reboot or radio reset has been performed in the interim.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/TelephonyManager.CallComposerException#ERROR_AUTHENTICATION_FAILED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.TelephonyManager.CallComposerException.ERROR_AUTHENTICATION_FAILED</code>.</a></format></para>
