        <summary>
          <para>Indicates that the InputStream passed to TelephonyManager.uploadCallComposerPicture(InputStream, String, Executor, OutcomeReceiver) was closed. The caller should retry if this error is encountered, and be sure to not close the stream before the callback is called this time.</para>
